WEBVTT

00:19.960 --> 00:23.280
♪Chasing wind, I set out afar♪

00:23.520 --> 00:26.760
♪The road ahead lost, my voice unheard♪

00:26.960 --> 00:28.880
♪I've tasted joy and sorrow♪

00:29.040 --> 00:32.400
♪Laying low, I plan every move♪

00:32.600 --> 00:35.920
♪With a mortal heart and lingering ties♪

00:36.120 --> 00:37.840
♪I'm roaming far and wide♪

00:38.200 --> 00:41.480
♪A twist of fate in desperate times♪

00:41.760 --> 00:45.000
♪A bond that outlives the dust of life♪

00:46.280 --> 00:49.680
♪Still chasing what immortality means♪

00:50.520 --> 00:55.120
♪Even eternity flashes by in a blink♪

00:58.960 --> 01:00.840
♪Don't mock my ordinary life♪

01:01.160 --> 01:04.840
♪I fight alone as chaos shakes the world♪

01:07.960 --> 01:09.880
♪Don't scorn my humble roots♪

01:10.120 --> 01:13.360
♪Kind at heart, ruthless when I must be♪

01:13.600 --> 01:15.520
♪Fate stirs with joy and grief beneath♪

01:15.760 --> 01:17.640
♪I hold the tide between life and death♪

01:18.080 --> 01:20.000
♪Faith carries me through endless dark♪

01:20.280 --> 01:22.160
♪And I return with a heart refined♪

01:26.000 --> 01:29.720
♪Forged by trial, I rise through three realms♪

01:29.720 --> 01:32.360
♪Reborn in the wheel of fate♪

01:32.360 --> 01:33.560
[The Immortal Ascension]

01:33.560 --> 01:34.760
[Adapted from the webnovel, The Immortal Ascension by Wangyu]

01:34.760 --> 01:35.960
[serialized in www.qidian.com under China Literature Limited]

01:36.040 --> 01:38.920
[Episode 16]

01:54.980 --> 01:56.310
You've exceeded your permission!

01:59.260 --> 02:00.600
I came to bring Yan some medicine.

02:01.650 --> 02:02.990
It is a secret concoction from my sect,

02:03.460 --> 02:04.440
capable of preserving one's power

02:04.530 --> 02:06.350
for a brief moment.

02:07.010 --> 02:07.760
Would you

02:08.500 --> 02:09.630
like to try it, Lord Yan?

03:14.770 --> 03:16.670
I was told you kept staring at a woman

03:17.020 --> 03:19.000
from Yellow Maple Valley in the city.

03:22.180 --> 03:23.550
You're mistaken.

03:24.130 --> 03:25.520
I already have Yan.

03:25.660 --> 03:27.110
I don't need another woman.

03:28.330 --> 03:30.310
But I have need of that woman from Yellow Maple Valley,

03:30.570 --> 03:31.960
so I need to scour more information.

03:32.380 --> 03:33.190
Worry not.

03:34.260 --> 03:36.000
No one knows my identity.

03:37.660 --> 03:38.470
In that case,

03:39.020 --> 03:41.360
perhaps we can postpone the plan against the common folks

03:41.820 --> 03:42.600
for the moment.

03:48.220 --> 03:48.830
Lord Yan,

03:53.010 --> 03:54.320
are you having a moment of compassion?

03:56.220 --> 03:56.920
Impossible.

03:57.660 --> 03:58.990
Those cultivators just arrived.

03:59.850 --> 04:01.080
I don't want anything

04:01.340 --> 04:02.430
to happen to you

04:02.780 --> 04:04.150
before the ceremony tomorrow.

04:07.340 --> 04:07.920
All right then.

04:08.890 --> 04:10.110
As you wish.

04:16.640 --> 04:19.520
[Lower City, Yan Clan Stronghold]

04:21.840 --> 04:32.040
[Mo's Apothecary]

04:44.130 --> 04:45.150
The plague is almost over.

04:46.540 --> 04:48.480
- Make sure to take the medicine. - Thanks, Miss Mo.

04:50.170 --> 04:50.670
Here.

04:51.500 --> 04:52.390
Thank you.

04:52.850 --> 04:53.320
Take this.

04:53.500 --> 04:54.240
Thanks.

04:57.850 --> 04:59.040
Take the medicine on time.

04:59.170 --> 05:00.480
Okay. Thank you.

05:05.570 --> 05:06.240
Mister.

05:07.780 --> 05:08.710
Miss Mo!

05:09.730 --> 05:10.710
Miss Mo!

05:12.660 --> 05:13.870
I have 20 gems here.

05:14.170 --> 05:15.360
Like what you said previously,

05:15.690 --> 05:17.640
I should have enough for two Moongazing Grass.

05:19.730 --> 05:21.640
Unfortunately, Miss Mo,

05:22.380 --> 05:23.580
many cultivators have arrived

05:23.580 --> 05:25.080
in this city.

05:26.060 --> 05:26.960
Moongazing Grass

05:27.170 --> 05:28.550
has become a scarcity.

05:29.450 --> 05:30.520
20 gems

05:30.850 --> 05:32.520
was the price from three months ago.

05:33.410 --> 05:34.320
You know what?

05:35.100 --> 05:36.080
I don't need the grass.

05:37.100 --> 05:37.870
Can I buy

05:38.170 --> 05:39.670
some seeds from you?

05:41.290 --> 05:41.710
That's

05:41.780 --> 05:42.800
a fool's errand.

05:43.780 --> 05:45.830
The spiritual power is weak in the Lower City.

05:45.850 --> 05:47.430
It's not conducive for cultivating herbs.

05:48.820 --> 05:49.480
Miss Mo,

05:49.980 --> 05:51.320
have you thought about

05:51.610 --> 05:52.390
moving

05:53.370 --> 05:54.760
to the upper level?

05:56.700 --> 05:57.520
Thank you.

05:58.140 --> 05:58.880
It's

05:59.370 --> 06:00.230
okay then.

06:00.730 --> 06:02.000
Miss Mo.

06:02.340 --> 06:03.190
Hear me out.

06:03.290 --> 06:03.960
Like I said,

06:04.050 --> 06:05.140
be my second wife and you can have

06:05.220 --> 06:06.070
whatever herbs

06:06.070 --> 06:06.860
you want.

06:08.020 --> 06:08.640
Miss Mo.

06:09.050 --> 06:09.560
Miss Mo.

06:10.050 --> 06:11.030
Hear me out!

06:11.370 --> 06:13.230
I am the biggest herb supplier in this stronghold.

06:13.460 --> 06:14.640
You'll have a comfortable life,

06:14.930 --> 06:16.270
even as my second wife!

06:16.700 --> 06:17.200
Miss Mo.

06:17.700 --> 06:18.350
Listen to me.

06:19.050 --> 06:19.960
A comfortable life awaits.

06:19.980 --> 06:20.390
Just

06:20.540 --> 06:21.270
come with me!

06:43.580 --> 06:44.270
Li?

06:51.460 --> 06:51.960
Miss Mo.

06:54.760 --> 06:56.440
♪The ripples disappear into the river♪

06:56.880 --> 07:00.000
♪My robe is soaked under the drizzle♪

07:01.340 --> 07:02.000
Over here,

07:02.340 --> 07:02.830
Li.

07:06.480 --> 07:08.920
♪The current flows swiftly, the mountains weigh heavily♪

07:09.480 --> 07:11.640
♪The setting sun outlines the returning fleet♪

07:12.840 --> 07:17.600
♪As I meander in the mortal world♪

07:20.880 --> 07:22.680
♪The breeze brushes through the corridor♪

07:23.080 --> 07:26.200
♪As the swallows whisper overhead♪

07:27.120 --> 07:31.960
♪The setting sun graces the bamboo forest, for whom do I harmonize?♪

07:32.680 --> 07:35.080
♪Leaning against the rails, water ripples below me♪

07:35.600 --> 07:37.840
♪The wind whispers to the forest♪

07:38.800 --> 07:43.800
♪I wander into the dream under the clear galaxy♪

07:47.320 --> 07:49.640
♪This journey that spans across the universe♪

07:50.160 --> 07:52.360
♪Feels both familiar and unfamiliar♪

07:53.320 --> 07:58.480
♪Looking at the various faces of our world♪

07:59.280 --> 08:01.560
♪Each word, each utterance♪

08:01.960 --> 08:04.280
♪Carries the hopes of a lifetime♪

08:05.520 --> 08:10.480
♪Let's make use of our present to build a legacy♪

08:10.920 --> 08:13.160
♪Reunion and departure, looking around...♪

08:13.900 --> 08:14.760
It's been many years.

08:15.580 --> 08:17.910
And you are as reticent as ever, Miss Mo.

08:21.170 --> 08:22.320
It's been a decade.

08:23.660 --> 08:24.710
How have you been,

08:24.810 --> 08:25.680
Li?

08:25.680 --> 08:27.480
♪And the gentle drizzle...♪

08:28.900 --> 08:29.560
I'm doing great.

08:31.580 --> 08:32.680
I didn't expect

08:33.340 --> 08:34.230
to run into you here.

08:38.100 --> 08:39.390
How is your family?

08:46.020 --> 08:47.030
They are gone.

08:52.340 --> 08:53.080
Three years ago,

08:53.660 --> 08:55.830
the Five-Color Sect found an affluent ally

08:56.140 --> 08:57.110
and became powerful.

08:58.660 --> 08:59.470
As you already know,

09:00.810 --> 09:03.080
they have been trying to usurp my family's legacy.

09:03.810 --> 09:05.760
My family was slaughtered in a night.

09:07.020 --> 09:08.590
Only I survived.

09:13.050 --> 09:14.030
To be frank,

09:15.340 --> 09:16.960
my family has expected that.

09:18.290 --> 09:19.440
They just didn't know

09:19.460 --> 09:20.680
it would happen this soon.

09:22.220 --> 09:23.560
And this brutally.

09:29.370 --> 09:30.150
The Five-Color Sect.

09:34.540 --> 09:35.200
What about Qu Hun?

09:35.810 --> 09:36.710
Did he not protect you?

09:39.660 --> 09:41.520
Several months before the tragedy,

09:42.370 --> 09:44.320
he lost control and ran to the mountain.

09:46.220 --> 09:47.710
I couldn't catch up to him.

10:58.130 --> 10:58.960
It's fine,

11:02.490 --> 11:03.320
Li.

11:04.100 --> 11:05.280
It's

11:06.100 --> 11:07.440
history anyway.

11:08.340 --> 11:09.230
I

11:09.460 --> 11:10.630
found my way here,

11:11.300 --> 11:12.710
and founded this apothecary.

11:13.820 --> 11:15.280
Even though I'm all alone,

11:15.890 --> 11:16.830
I'm content

11:17.980 --> 11:19.440
with my life.

11:46.100 --> 11:47.200
The tea has gotten cold.

11:48.250 --> 11:49.160
Li,

11:49.420 --> 11:50.110
drink this instead.

11:50.370 --> 11:51.680
I just brewed it.

11:54.770 --> 11:56.680
How did you cross that cultivator just now?

12:03.100 --> 12:03.960
Li,

12:04.220 --> 12:05.710
no need to worry about me.

12:06.490 --> 12:08.320
I can protect myself.

12:10.610 --> 12:11.320
Okay.

12:13.460 --> 12:14.590
Just let me know

12:14.940 --> 12:15.750
if you need my help.

12:16.530 --> 12:17.110
Don't be shy.

12:23.940 --> 12:25.440
I'm fine.

12:26.130 --> 12:27.440
Li,

12:27.820 --> 12:29.320
stay here to rest up if you want.

12:30.420 --> 12:32.110
I still need to retrieve some herbs.

13:04.820 --> 13:05.440
Let me do it.

14:04.650 --> 14:05.470
Take a break.

14:10.460 --> 14:11.110
Let me do it.

14:11.530 --> 14:12.230
I can carry it.

14:30.010 --> 14:31.230
People roam here in haste.

14:31.650 --> 14:33.440
No one has the time to look up.

14:34.730 --> 14:37.280
To me, this is such a relief.

14:38.340 --> 14:39.290
Now I understand

14:39.290 --> 14:41.440
why Han Li wishes to avoid attention.

14:42.130 --> 14:44.630
Solitude feels good.

14:46.370 --> 14:47.960
Why must I have

14:48.370 --> 14:50.350
the gift of enchantment?

14:51.370 --> 14:52.470
A mortal

14:52.490 --> 14:53.920
can live freely.

14:54.850 --> 14:57.280
Yet I always attract conflicts

14:57.370 --> 14:59.200
even though I don't mean to hurt anyone.

14:59.820 --> 15:00.830
I have no freedom.

15:01.610 --> 15:02.870
I arrived here yesterday.

15:03.130 --> 15:04.350
And I heard that there were

15:04.580 --> 15:05.710
some mysteries in the Lower City.

15:06.730 --> 15:07.710
Are you aware of them?

15:08.530 --> 15:09.800
Mysteries?

15:10.530 --> 15:11.710
Like the sudden death of some commoners

15:11.890 --> 15:12.870
of some commoners

15:13.010 --> 15:13.990
or rookie cultivators.

15:14.770 --> 15:15.990
I did hear that some people

15:16.220 --> 15:18.230
disappeared under mysterious circumstances at night.

15:18.940 --> 15:21.040
But no one has found their bodies.

15:41.130 --> 15:41.960
Miss,

15:43.060 --> 15:44.110
it is a great evening tonight.

15:44.300 --> 15:45.350
Why are you sulking alone?

15:47.420 --> 15:48.280
Relax.

15:48.580 --> 15:49.080
We are not

15:49.220 --> 15:49.920
bad guys.

15:50.580 --> 15:51.870
We just hate to see

15:51.890 --> 15:52.800
a frown on your face.

15:54.130 --> 15:54.800
Miss,

15:55.370 --> 15:56.200
try this.

15:57.850 --> 15:58.470
It makes me

15:58.890 --> 15:59.680
feel happy?

16:02.130 --> 16:03.710
Have you not heard of this saying?

16:04.340 --> 16:05.470
Liquor can drown

16:05.650 --> 16:06.040
your sorrow

16:06.220 --> 16:06.710
away.

16:08.300 --> 16:09.510
We're not trying to make you drunk.

16:10.370 --> 16:11.590
We just don't want

16:11.980 --> 16:13.110
to see you sulk.

16:14.460 --> 16:16.160
And I know you're not bad guys.

16:16.730 --> 16:18.800
I just can't bring myself to drink the moon in this cup.

16:19.850 --> 16:21.560
You worry for naught.

16:23.420 --> 16:25.040
The moon will appear in all things that flow.

16:25.420 --> 16:27.110
Just as all things that flow will reflect the moon.

16:28.890 --> 16:30.750
So long as your cup is filled,

16:33.250 --> 16:33.590
I...

16:34.250 --> 16:35.750
The moon will always be in your hands.

16:37.610 --> 16:38.080
Well said.

16:39.460 --> 16:39.870
Thank you.

16:40.700 --> 16:41.230
It's beautiful.

16:41.530 --> 16:41.960
Cheers.

16:42.370 --> 16:43.280
- Cheers. - Cheers.

16:47.530 --> 16:48.230
It burns.

16:48.730 --> 16:49.440
That's it.

16:50.610 --> 16:50.990
Again.

16:51.820 --> 16:52.320
You can drink.

16:53.370 --> 16:53.710
Okay.

16:53.770 --> 16:54.470
You can drink, miss.

16:54.580 --> 16:55.040
You hold your cup.

16:55.890 --> 16:56.350
Let me fill it.

17:08.100 --> 17:08.870
Li,

17:09.530 --> 17:11.510
you must be a powerful cultivator now.

17:13.220 --> 17:14.320
I only reached the Foundation Establishment Stage.

17:17.940 --> 17:18.470
Well,

17:19.340 --> 17:20.110
just strong enough

17:20.340 --> 17:21.110
to protect myself.

17:30.860 --> 17:31.610
Beautiful.

17:32.370 --> 17:33.030
Look over there.

17:35.470 --> 17:36.220
It's so beautiful.

17:40.060 --> 17:40.870
So pretty.

17:41.250 --> 17:42.040
Look there.

17:51.250 --> 17:52.470
I am Dong Xuan'er of Yellow Maple Valley.

17:52.700 --> 17:54.110
How may I address you?

17:55.100 --> 17:56.510
I am Wuyouzi of Clear Void Sect.

17:57.220 --> 17:58.830
I am Ba Chushui of Giant Sword Sect.

17:59.610 --> 18:00.350
Are you here

18:00.460 --> 18:01.800
for the betrothal ceremony?

18:03.180 --> 18:04.590
We're here to catch the bad guys.

18:05.460 --> 18:05.830
But

18:06.460 --> 18:07.110
this doesn't matter.

18:07.180 --> 18:08.590
Come. Drink up.

18:08.770 --> 18:09.110
Come.

18:09.370 --> 18:10.680
Yes, it doesn't matter.

18:11.180 --> 18:12.280
- Come. - Thank you.

18:26.320 --> 18:26.890
Great!

18:31.500 --> 18:32.360
There's more.

18:36.180 --> 18:36.970
Wow!

18:39.910 --> 18:40.830
Bravo.

18:44.290 --> 18:46.440
I've never seen him this happy before.

18:47.290 --> 18:48.880
He found a new girl

18:49.420 --> 18:51.600
this soon in a foreign place.

18:55.140 --> 18:55.680
Let's go down

18:56.050 --> 18:56.750
and check it out.

18:57.620 --> 18:57.990
Well,

18:58.090 --> 18:59.550
we shall take our leave.

18:59.660 --> 19:00.470
We'll be admiring the fireworks.

19:00.770 --> 19:01.750
Enjoy the drink.

19:03.050 --> 19:03.710
Thank you.

19:04.980 --> 19:05.310
Let's go.

19:05.460 --> 19:05.840
Let's go.

19:27.600 --> 19:31.520
♪Shards of dreams inside a dream...♪

19:31.530 --> 19:32.550
Li,

19:33.460 --> 19:34.710
is it impossible to be

19:35.420 --> 19:36.310
a cultivator

19:36.710 --> 19:38.990
without a spirit root?

19:39.880 --> 19:42.560
♪Years slipped by as I lingered on♪

19:43.120 --> 19:45.400
♪Old scenes rise again♪

19:46.520 --> 19:52.520
♪Too hard to forget, easier just to miss♪

19:54.520 --> 19:58.920
♪They say the past fades like smoke♪

20:00.600 --> 20:05.040
♪But looking back still stirs the ache♪

20:06.560 --> 20:09.320
♪This noisy world, this lonely page♪

20:10.040 --> 20:12.160
♪Swept away by time♪

20:13.560 --> 20:19.280
♪Eyes once looked far now lost in the shift♪

20:20.480 --> 20:25.440
♪Autumn winds stir, smoke curls once more♪

20:26.600 --> 20:31.480
♪Like clouds on the edge of sky returning to my eyes♪

20:33.240 --> 20:38.120
♪Looking back from the mountaintop, time lost its name♪

20:39.560 --> 20:45.680
♪Was it yesterday or tomorrow?♪

20:46.800 --> 20:51.840
♪The world has changed beyond recall♪

20:52.480 --> 20:55.240
♪Time will fade♪

20:55.840 --> 20:58.040
♪All the words ever spoken♪

20:59.600 --> 21:02.600
♪Only this longing remains♪

21:03.200 --> 21:08.560
♪Crossing centuries and days♪

21:09.800 --> 21:16.480
♪In a fleeting moment we call eternity♪

21:20.250 --> 21:20.840
You there.

21:22.180 --> 21:22.510
Come.

21:24.980 --> 21:27.310
You're hit by my enchantment.

21:27.980 --> 21:28.790
Look at me.

21:29.140 --> 21:29.750
Look at me.

21:29.980 --> 21:32.640
I am Dong Xuan'er of Yellow Maple Valley.

21:49.530 --> 21:51.990
You are all enchanted.

21:52.530 --> 21:53.160
Look at me.

21:53.660 --> 21:54.270
Look at me.

21:54.490 --> 21:55.360
Oh, no.

21:55.380 --> 21:55.880
She's in danger.

21:58.220 --> 21:58.790
Miss Mo,

21:59.140 --> 21:59.920
please go home first.

22:00.330 --> 22:00.880
I still have things to do.

22:01.330 --> 22:01.990
I must go now.

22:10.980 --> 22:11.710
Keep this.

22:12.330 --> 22:14.070
If those cultivators give you trouble,

22:14.620 --> 22:15.640
throw it at them.

22:18.380 --> 22:19.550
These are the seeds of mystic herbs

22:19.860 --> 22:21.160
and the pills good for mortals.

22:21.620 --> 22:22.440
You can take them,

22:22.940 --> 22:23.880
or sell them after refining.

22:25.420 --> 22:26.550
Don't sell them for too cheap.

22:27.010 --> 22:27.680
They are good pills.

22:31.290 --> 22:32.070
If anything,

22:32.530 --> 22:33.160
leave a message

22:33.380 --> 22:33.880
at the inn.

22:35.140 --> 22:36.440
Will we meet again?

22:42.090 --> 22:43.200
I'll see you off.

22:44.250 --> 22:44.840
Go home.

22:46.090 --> 22:46.600
Okay.

23:21.290 --> 23:22.400
So beautiful.

23:22.530 --> 23:23.160
My dear,

23:23.250 --> 23:24.680
just come with me.

23:25.140 --> 23:26.840
I'll make you feel good.

23:26.860 --> 23:27.990
I'm not your dear.

23:28.420 --> 23:30.960
I'm Dong Xuan'er of Yellow Maple Valley.

23:31.900 --> 23:32.640
I

23:32.660 --> 23:34.470
know that.

23:35.660 --> 23:36.640
You know me?

23:37.900 --> 23:38.550
I know

23:38.570 --> 23:40.550
your father, mother, grandmother, and grandfather.

23:40.570 --> 23:41.840
All of them.

23:42.010 --> 23:43.470
I can recite your family lineage.

23:44.810 --> 23:45.600
Oh, I know now.

23:46.050 --> 23:48.310
You're enchanted by me.

23:48.980 --> 23:50.030
Yes.

23:51.330 --> 23:53.470
I'm so enchanted by you.

24:09.660 --> 24:11.030
Where does this guy come from?

24:11.330 --> 24:12.030
Who are you?

24:12.570 --> 24:13.400
Don't get in our way.

24:14.700 --> 24:16.030
You want to play the hero?

24:16.290 --> 24:16.990
Are you strong enough?

24:18.980 --> 24:20.680
You want to play the hero?

24:20.810 --> 24:22.270
Are you strong enough?

24:22.860 --> 24:23.990
You two

24:24.140 --> 24:24.750
should fight.

24:26.090 --> 24:27.710
I'll go with the winner.

24:27.900 --> 24:28.310
Okay?

24:29.010 --> 24:29.310
All right.

24:29.660 --> 24:29.990
Come.

24:30.380 --> 24:31.120
Fight.

24:35.810 --> 24:36.360
Fight now.

24:36.660 --> 24:36.960
Fight.

24:46.730 --> 24:48.070
What a weird technique.

24:48.900 --> 24:50.440
Why won't he show his face?

24:51.250 --> 24:52.680
Perhaps he doesn't want to draw attention.

25:04.140 --> 25:04.790
Wow.

25:05.050 --> 25:06.160
That's amazing.

25:08.700 --> 25:09.400
Who's there?

25:14.980 --> 25:15.990
He fled.

25:19.810 --> 25:20.510
You won.

25:20.940 --> 25:21.600
I'll come with you!

25:32.620 --> 25:35.270
You are all enchanted by me.

25:35.770 --> 25:37.990
I am Dong Xuan'er of Yellow Maple Valley.

25:38.730 --> 25:40.400
Can you resist my enchantment?

25:50.180 --> 25:50.680
Oh, no.

25:51.530 --> 25:52.400
If my master

25:53.010 --> 25:54.360
and mentors see her like this,

25:54.900 --> 25:56.160
they'll hold me accountable.

25:56.980 --> 25:57.920
I need to sort this out first.

26:10.180 --> 26:10.960
Han,

26:11.770 --> 26:12.640
where am I?

26:17.010 --> 26:17.640
Drink the medicine.

26:18.730 --> 26:19.880
What medicine is this?

26:20.250 --> 26:20.960
Stop staring at me.

26:21.490 --> 26:21.790
Drink it.

26:29.860 --> 26:30.360
Dong Xuan'er,

26:31.330 --> 26:33.070
I told you to stop using your enchantment.

26:33.460 --> 26:34.550
That man took advantage of you and damaged

26:34.980 --> 26:35.880
your spirit.

26:36.570 --> 26:37.880
You need a few days to fully recover.

26:44.180 --> 26:45.790
We promised to stay out

26:46.010 --> 26:47.160
of each other's business.

26:47.460 --> 26:49.230
Why are you following me?

26:53.010 --> 26:53.750
Following you?

26:54.180 --> 26:54.680
I'm following

26:54.730 --> 26:55.790
your kidnapper.

26:56.730 --> 26:57.470
I've sensed

26:57.900 --> 26:58.920
his gaze on you many times

26:59.330 --> 27:00.120
in the city.

27:00.570 --> 27:01.440
He's following me?

27:01.730 --> 27:02.070
Yes.

27:05.330 --> 27:06.400
I have an ominous feeling.

27:07.700 --> 27:08.710
Stay close to me tomorrow.

27:08.940 --> 27:09.600
We'll go back as soon

27:09.770 --> 27:10.550
as the ceremony ends.

27:11.090 --> 27:12.030
Obey

27:12.660 --> 27:13.750
my order for now.

27:14.290 --> 27:15.990
Then, we stay out of each other's business.

27:16.490 --> 27:17.200
This is not a negotiation.

27:18.460 --> 27:19.310
Okay.

27:21.530 --> 27:22.750
Where are you going, Han?

27:23.330 --> 27:24.120
I mean,

27:24.290 --> 27:26.310
can you stay the night?

27:29.220 --> 27:30.120
I will keep watch tonight.

27:46.460 --> 27:47.990
I hope you won't

27:48.460 --> 27:50.440
tell my master about what happened today.

27:56.250 --> 27:58.640
I never intend to cross anyone.

27:59.050 --> 28:01.400
Why is it my fault every time?

28:09.090 --> 28:09.790
All right.

28:11.220 --> 28:11.710
I know

28:12.490 --> 28:13.840
you don't mean to use your gift.

28:14.900 --> 28:15.600
I won't

28:16.090 --> 28:16.790
tell anyone

28:17.420 --> 28:18.310
about today.

28:22.860 --> 28:23.510
You promise?

28:31.140 --> 28:31.840
I promise.

28:39.180 --> 28:40.120
Han, I'm hungry.

28:40.730 --> 28:41.200
Sleep.

28:42.140 --> 28:43.640
But what about my tummy?

28:44.420 --> 28:45.510
You don't feel hungry when you're asleep.

28:45.770 --> 28:47.440
But I want to...

28:52.140 --> 28:53.510
You're boring.

29:03.530 --> 29:04.400
Han,

29:05.180 --> 29:06.470
is it cold over there?

29:10.800 --> 29:13.720
[Quarry, Yan Clan Stronghold]

29:30.860 --> 29:31.550
Quit staring.

29:32.010 --> 29:32.840
Where are you from?

29:33.620 --> 29:34.640
I am Xuan Yue of Moonshadow Sect.

29:34.900 --> 29:35.920
My sect has instructed me

29:36.180 --> 29:37.920
to retrieve this month's gems.

29:46.730 --> 29:47.230
Xuan.

29:48.330 --> 29:48.960
Xuan.

29:52.090 --> 29:53.680
They are our loyal patron.

29:53.770 --> 29:54.400
No need to check.

29:54.530 --> 29:55.310
Go back to your work.

29:58.700 --> 29:59.070
Follow me.

30:05.460 --> 30:07.160
How come you're early, Xuan?

30:07.860 --> 30:09.160
We're two days

30:09.290 --> 30:10.160
before the deadline.

30:10.900 --> 30:11.680
My sect needs it

30:11.730 --> 30:12.790
urgently.

30:14.180 --> 30:14.840
Can you

30:18.730 --> 30:19.640
help us?

30:26.220 --> 30:27.470
Oh, come on.

30:27.700 --> 30:28.750
We always reserve the best

30:29.010 --> 30:30.710
for your sect.

30:31.140 --> 30:31.680
Enjoy your tea

30:31.770 --> 30:32.270
first.

30:42.050 --> 30:42.550
My friend,

30:43.810 --> 30:44.710
what has happened

30:45.420 --> 30:46.440
to the quarry?

30:47.460 --> 30:48.790
I see many new faces.

30:50.250 --> 30:51.550
Young Lady is getting married.

30:51.940 --> 30:53.310
So we station more people here

30:53.530 --> 30:54.270
for better security.

30:56.140 --> 30:56.880
The groom

30:57.770 --> 30:59.030
is so fortunate then.

30:59.700 --> 31:00.640
He will own

31:01.770 --> 31:02.710
the entire quarry.

31:04.330 --> 31:05.230
He got lucky.

31:07.700 --> 31:08.880
Which sect does the groom

31:09.220 --> 31:10.160
hail from?

31:11.290 --> 31:12.120
He is fortunate enough

31:12.330 --> 31:12.920
to marry

31:12.940 --> 31:14.920
the daughter of Lord Yan.

31:17.140 --> 31:18.070
I heard he's

31:18.090 --> 31:19.030
a foreign cultivator.

31:19.980 --> 31:20.920
A foreign cultivator?

31:23.460 --> 31:24.120
From where?

31:24.730 --> 31:25.400
What background?

31:26.730 --> 31:28.160
Stop asking already.

31:28.490 --> 31:29.440
This is for the higher-up.

31:29.530 --> 31:30.470
We should just stay quiet.

31:30.770 --> 31:31.750
Come. Have some tea.

31:39.460 --> 31:40.710
The Mountain Barrier is hit?

31:41.570 --> 31:41.920
Xuan,

31:42.250 --> 31:42.790
stay here.

31:42.900 --> 31:43.550
I'll be back soon.

31:45.570 --> 31:45.990
Ouch.

31:46.140 --> 31:46.600
Easy.

31:46.660 --> 31:47.400
Tell me now.

31:48.250 --> 31:49.200
Why mobilize so many people

31:49.570 --> 31:50.510
for the betrothal ceremony tomorrow?

31:51.730 --> 31:52.510
Ouch.

31:52.940 --> 31:53.310
Xuan.

31:53.620 --> 31:54.680
Stop asking.

31:55.180 --> 31:56.920
For old time's sake,

31:57.460 --> 31:58.470
listen to me.

32:00.180 --> 32:01.310
Run.

32:11.900 --> 32:13.920
I might not be able to return here again.

32:14.530 --> 32:15.510
I need to carry out

32:15.900 --> 32:17.030
my plan soon.

32:25.700 --> 32:26.310
Grandmaster.

32:26.530 --> 32:26.960
Yes?

32:28.090 --> 32:29.750
The Jiang Kingdom and The Cheqi Kingdom are no more.

32:30.420 --> 32:31.230
The whole royalty

32:31.330 --> 32:32.440
was eradicated.

32:32.980 --> 32:34.160
The Ghost Spirit Sect did it.

32:35.570 --> 32:36.710
Inform all elders

32:36.810 --> 32:37.640
to meet

32:38.380 --> 32:39.470
at Yellow Maple Valley for a discussion.

32:40.250 --> 32:41.440
And tell Xuan Yue

32:41.980 --> 32:43.710
to report back about the Yue Kingdom's border.

32:45.010 --> 32:46.030
Noted, Grandmaster.

32:46.330 --> 32:46.880
Go now.

32:50.570 --> 32:51.880
Is a war about to break out?

33:00.520 --> 33:02.720
[Wedding]

33:07.730 --> 33:08.560
It's so crowded.

33:12.570 --> 33:13.310
Han, Dong.

33:13.460 --> 33:13.790
Morning.

33:14.090 --> 33:14.840
- Morning. - Morning.

33:15.010 --> 33:15.750
Morning.

33:15.860 --> 33:16.550
- Morning. - Morning.

33:17.660 --> 33:18.470
Did you two

33:18.860 --> 33:20.070
find anything last night?

33:22.090 --> 33:22.680
Well...

33:23.220 --> 33:24.160
The fireworks were mesmerizing.

33:24.250 --> 33:25.270
The liquor was intoxicating.

33:25.700 --> 33:26.120
Yes.

33:26.570 --> 33:27.680
After the ceremony,

33:27.730 --> 33:28.470
we'll return to what we came here for.

33:29.010 --> 33:29.440
Exactly.

33:29.530 --> 33:29.960
Han,

33:30.290 --> 33:30.910
join us.

33:32.380 --> 33:32.710
Sure.

33:33.010 --> 33:33.400
I'll join you.

33:33.660 --> 33:34.640
- We do it together. - We do it together.

33:34.860 --> 33:35.600
Do what together?

33:36.730 --> 33:37.270
It's a secret.

33:39.420 --> 33:39.880
Listen.

33:40.050 --> 33:40.920
We can't...

33:41.090 --> 33:41.840
You said someone

33:42.330 --> 33:43.880
was following me last night.

33:44.180 --> 33:44.990
Did you find him?

33:46.090 --> 33:46.640
No.

33:47.940 --> 33:49.030
But you must stay close to me.

33:49.530 --> 33:49.990
Don't go anywhere.

34:21.860 --> 34:22.640
Look, Han.

34:22.900 --> 34:23.680
It's so festive in front.

34:23.940 --> 34:24.880
Let's check it out.

34:37.090 --> 34:37.790
How odd.

34:38.730 --> 34:40.030
I sense something ominous.

34:43.840 --> 34:47.520
[Yongning Gate]

34:53.690 --> 34:54.620
It's majestic.

34:55.480 --> 34:56.440
The grandeur!

35:16.290 --> 35:17.270
Let's stand in the front row.

35:18.220 --> 35:18.710
Stay behind me.

36:05.170 --> 36:06.590
Where is Lord Yan?

36:06.900 --> 36:07.280
I know, right?

36:07.980 --> 36:09.030
It's a betrothal ceremony.

36:09.260 --> 36:10.240
None of the elders is here.

36:14.380 --> 36:15.240
Yan Ruyan

36:15.740 --> 36:16.720
looks weird.

36:35.170 --> 36:35.960
He was the person

36:37.130 --> 36:37.720
from last night.

36:40.460 --> 36:41.280
Him?

36:42.170 --> 36:42.960
Why would Lord Yan

36:42.980 --> 36:44.760
pick someone like him to be his son-in-law?

36:44.900 --> 36:45.360
Hush.

36:46.860 --> 36:47.990
There's something off about this ceremony.

36:48.650 --> 36:49.150
Follow me.

36:49.980 --> 36:50.840
Welcome

36:51.530 --> 36:53.760
to the betrothal ceremony between Yan and me.

36:56.340 --> 36:57.110
The banquet

36:58.940 --> 36:59.880
begins now.

37:33.780 --> 37:34.110
Wait.

37:40.860 --> 37:41.800
My power is all gone.

37:49.490 --> 37:49.920
Oh, no.

37:50.300 --> 37:51.360
My power has been suppressed.

37:51.780 --> 37:52.590
The Wind Boat doesn't work here.

37:53.010 --> 37:53.550
Han.

37:53.780 --> 37:54.920
My power has been suppressed.

37:59.140 --> 38:00.390
My power has been suppressed too.

38:04.640 --> 38:05.100
Run!

38:57.980 --> 38:59.360
It's the Blood Spirit Spell by the Ghost Spirit Sect.

38:59.570 --> 38:59.920
Run!

39:00.050 --> 39:00.470
Run!

39:04.980 --> 39:06.070
Yan and I

39:06.460 --> 39:07.990
received your gifts with thanks.

39:15.050 --> 39:16.150
The so-called

39:16.860 --> 39:18.880
righteous seven sects pride themselves

39:19.210 --> 39:20.990
with their generosity.

39:23.980 --> 39:25.920
Then surrender your power

39:27.010 --> 39:29.440
to save the future heiress of the Yan Clan.

39:44.780 --> 39:47.190
At this critical juncture,

39:51.940 --> 39:54.190
forgive me.

40:30.420 --> 40:31.400
There is

40:33.570 --> 40:35.670
no turning back for my clan.

40:37.420 --> 40:38.320
Lord Yan,

40:39.050 --> 40:40.960
these people are not dead.

40:41.490 --> 40:43.320
They merely turn into power

40:44.420 --> 40:46.550
and are fused with Yan.

40:47.530 --> 40:49.590
They should thank me

40:51.900 --> 40:53.670
for this honor.

40:57.980 --> 40:58.400
No.

40:58.980 --> 41:00.360
They should thank you,

41:02.530 --> 41:03.990
Lord Yan.

41:05.570 --> 41:06.470
We made

41:06.570 --> 41:08.150
a Truedeath Oath.

41:08.780 --> 41:10.440
If you fail to save Yan,

41:12.900 --> 41:14.590
I will make you pay.

41:16.530 --> 41:18.550
Yan is my wife.

41:20.090 --> 41:22.030
I want her back more than you do.

41:48.940 --> 41:51.030
Yan is still unconscious.

41:51.650 --> 41:53.510
Despite all this power,

41:55.130 --> 41:56.550
she does not wake up.

41:56.980 --> 41:57.800
My wife

41:58.420 --> 42:00.840
sure has a big appetite.

42:14.980 --> 42:16.510
Be patient.

42:16.860 --> 42:19.070
A few escaped just now.

42:20.340 --> 42:22.590
I'll chase after them

42:23.300 --> 42:24.990
and feed them to Yan.

43:02.120 --> 43:07.440
♪Shards of dreams inside a dream♪

43:08.680 --> 43:14.080
♪A pale moon falls into mirrored skies♪

43:14.200 --> 43:17.400
♪Years slipped by as I lingered on♪

43:17.640 --> 43:19.880
♪Old scenes rise again♪

43:20.280 --> 43:23.120
♪Too hard to forget♪

43:23.640 --> 43:27.600
♪Easier just to miss♪

43:28.440 --> 43:33.920
♪They say the past fades like smoke♪

43:35.080 --> 43:40.360
♪But looking back still stirs the ache♪

43:40.960 --> 43:44.000
♪This noisy world, this lonely page♪

43:44.280 --> 43:46.400
♪Swept away by time♪

43:47.040 --> 43:49.680
♪Eyes once looked far♪

43:50.160 --> 43:54.120
♪Now lost in the shift♪

43:54.600 --> 43:57.440
♪Autumn winds stir♪

43:57.720 --> 43:59.640
♪Smoke curls once more♪

44:00.080 --> 44:02.520
♪Like clouds on the edge of sky♪

44:02.840 --> 44:06.360
♪Returning to my eyes♪

44:06.920 --> 44:09.880
♪Looking back from the mountaintop♪

44:10.200 --> 44:13.120
♪Time lost its name♪

44:13.520 --> 44:16.360
♪Was it yesterday♪

44:16.760 --> 44:20.320
♪Or tomorrow?♪

44:20.680 --> 44:23.520
♪The world has changed♪

44:23.920 --> 44:25.760
♪Beyond recall♪

44:26.320 --> 44:28.040
♪Time will fade♪

44:28.440 --> 44:33.240
♪All the words ever spoken♪

44:33.920 --> 44:36.800
♪Only this longing remains♪

44:37.280 --> 44:42.560
♪Crossing centuries and days♪

44:43.680 --> 44:50.320
♪In a fleeting moment we call eternity♪

44:50.800 --> 45:00.520
♪In a fleeting moment called eternity♪
